WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:03.950
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:19.709 --> 00:00:22.126
(soft music)

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.910
- [Narrator] Sant'Antioco, Sardinia

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.060
is home to a rare artisan,

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.770
thought to be the only
person left in the world

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:34.950
to weave sea silk, a rare fiber harvested

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.660
from the saliva of a
species of endangered clams

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.298
that live here on the ocean floor.

00:00:41.298 --> 00:00:44.965
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.680
- [Narrator] For more
than a thousand years

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.540
the techniques of collecting
and weaving sea silk

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.730
have been passed down through her family,

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.832
making Chiara the 28th generation.

00:00:57.832 --> 00:01:01.499
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:18.330
- [Narrator] The ancient process of diving

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:21.440
to harvest the silk from
the clams is kept a secret

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.876
for fear of environmental damage.

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:27.543
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:01.727 --> 00:02:03.610
- [Narrator] Chiara uses a secret formula

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:06.310
to soak the thread and uses her voice

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.450
to activate the mixture.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:10.650
Thus allowing it to shine like gold.

00:02:20.085 --> 00:02:23.752
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.780
- [Narrator] Bound by a sacred sea oath,

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.466
Chiara how vowed to make
any money from her work.

00:02:40.466 --> 00:02:44.216
(speaking foreign language)

